      why: "PMT's biggest leak is people who are interested but not ready to commit to a full weekend. A tiny first yes (a quiz, a text for dates, a small deposit) and a genuinely useful add-on after booking grow revenue per customer without more ad spend. Trades can add maintenance plans the same way.",
